      "problem": "Consider the matrix\n  \n\n$$\nA=[\\begin{aligned}7 & 2 & -1 & 5 & 0 \\\\ 4 & 8 & 3 & -6 & 1\\end{aligned}].\n$$\n\nWhat are the dimensions of ${A}^{T}?$\n\n${A}^{T}$ is a \n\n{{field-1}}\n$\\times $\n{{field-2}}\n matrix.",
